{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cchaos generates two principles, and the two principles generate four phenomena\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The Four\u00a0</strong>is a 2D platform jumping puzzle game, set against the backdrop of ancient Chinese mythology. as a life of\u00a0the Two principles world, player will seal <strong>The Four\u00a0</strong>Mythical Creatures: LOONG,  BIRD, TIGER, and TORTOISNAKE\u2014that have awakened once again, and explore the secrets of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes classic platform puzzles, and something new:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 elements: Wood (LOONG), Fire (BIRD), Metal (TIGER), and Water (TORTOISNAKE). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental skills: Elemental energy will bring different skills to the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental Planes: Influenced by <strong>The Four</strong>, the world has generated new dimensions\u2014the elemental planes, and the\u00a0road ahead lies within them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 element areas: Each area containing 4 scenes and a boss, each\u00a0scene containing approximately 16 puzzles.\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player will not die, but the road ahead is not easy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early access will open the Wood(LOONG) area, other secrets of the world are producing(BIRD, TIGER, TORTOISNAKE, ?).</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980010/5d5922a03adabbf6b35fcbfb5778ee3b2667aed2.jpg"},{"name":"One Piece","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980010/d40e2249bb0652c08c1e24b4996596cfdf0e6f2e.jpg"},{"name":"The Secret","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2980010/5